<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIA MAY CPI 2 PCT MO/MO, 10.8 YR/YR.</title>
<headline>ESTONIA MAY CPI 2 PCT MO/MO, 10.8 YR/YR.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Estonian consumer prices rose by</p>
<p>a monthly 2.0 percent in May for a year-on-year inflation rate</p>
<p>of 10.8 percent, the country's statistics office said on Friday.</p>
<p>    ESTONIAN CPI		    May 1997  April 97   May 1996</p>
<p>    Month-on-month change (pct)   2.0	1.9	  0.6</p>
<p>    Year on Year change (pct)     10.8     9.2	 26.7</p>
<p>    Index change (1993 = 100)     260.2    255.0	234.8</p>
<p>--Tallinn newsroom +372 620 9202/1 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
